        dct:description "Radial J0 ocellus growth animation — docs/media/drosophila_serrata_turing_wavelength_s0_growth.gif: rendered output of models/2026-delphi10000-drosophila-serrata-turing-wavelength-s0.py at 0c76d15d, image/gif, 3313138 B, 640×520 px, 12 frames, artifact_sha256 2fbf667000d2f0d9c417e8cba8dfaf6605316b7eef9594423c985db302f2ec69 (sha256 2fbf667000d2f0d9c417e8cba8dfaf6605316b7eef9594423c985db302f2ec69), spec_fingerprint a3c4b3d65dab3b0ebfbf973810a2da1a980cfa0eca08496d6d9c3676418453c9" .
